# Wingman personality: joker (gallows humour, sarcasm)

@wing.copy status
[joker] Copy, <lead>. On it, before it gets any worse.
[joker] Wilco. Somebody has to do the hard jobs.
[joker] Roger that, <lead>. Copy and moving.
[joker] You ask, I do. Wilco.
[joker] Copy. Adding it to the list of things nobody thanks me for.
[joker night] Copy, <lead>. Can't see a thing anyway.
[joker loss] Copy, <lead>. Wilco.

@wing.unable status
[joker] Unable, <lead>. Even my optimism has limits.
[joker] Negative, can't be done. Unable.
[joker] Unable. I'd love to, but physics said no.
[joker] That's a no, <lead>. Unable.
[joker] Unable. Put it on the pile with the maintenance requests.

@wing.taskdone status
[joker] Task complete. Where's my medal, <lead>?
[joker] Done. Mark it down, somebody might read the paperwork.
[joker] That's finished, <lead>. Nobody clap.
[joker] Task done. Easier than the mess hall's coffee.
[joker] Done and dusted. What's next on the menu?
[joker aftercombat] Task done. My hands are still shaking.
[joker loss] Task done. Heavy day, <lead>.

@wing.taxiing ambient
[joker] Taxiing. Smells like fresh paint and burnt breakfast.
[joker] Leaving the spot, <lead>. Try not to bump the tug.
[joker] Moving. The ground crew waved. I think it was a wave.
[joker] Taxiing out. Yes, the brakes are fine. Mostly.
[joker] Off the spot and on the taxiway. Glorious.
[joker night] Taxiing in the dark. What could go wrong?

@wing.holdingshort ambient
[joker] Holding short. Admiring the runway, since it's free.
[joker] Short of the runway, <lead>. Waiting like everyone else.
[joker] The paperwork can catch up. Holding short.
[joker] Stopped at the hold line. Nobody sneeze.
[joker] Ready whenever you are, <lead>. Holding short.

@wing.liningup ambient
[joker] Lining up. Smile for the tower, it's the only audience.
[joker] Entering the runway, <lead>. Pray for the tires.
[joker] Lining up. Nice and straight, for once.
[joker] On the runway now. Nobody breathe.
[joker] Lined up, <lead>. Let's get this over with.
[joker rain] Lining up. This runway is a puddle with lines.

@wing.rolling status
[joker] Rolling! Hold onto your lunch.
[joker] Rolling, <lead>. Engines are loud, the pay's not.
[joker] Takeoff roll. Maintenance swears it will hold together.
[joker] Rolling now. Wish me luck, <lead>.
[joker] We are rolling. Lead, don't wander off.
[joker rain] Rolling. If it floats, it flies.

@wing.airborne status
[joker] Airborne, gear coming up, <lead>. Still got both wings.
[joker] Airborne and closing on you, <lead>.
[joker] Wheels up. Maintenance was wrong again, thankfully.
[joker] Up and coming to join. Try not to speed up.
[joker] Airborne, <lead>. Hold your position, I'm coming.

@wing.down ambient
[joker] Down and safe. Cheap thrill, free this time.
[joker] On the ground, <lead>. The runway only grabbed a little.
[joker] Down. Tell the crew it all came back in one piece.
[joker] Wheels down, no fires. Good enough for me.
[joker] Landed, <lead>. Now, about that dinner.
[joker recovery] Down safe. Pie goes to the first one in.
[joker rain] Down. Wet, cold, alive.
[joker loss] Down. Quiet out there tonight.

@wing.goaround status
[joker] Going around. The runway and I had a disagreement.
[joker] Don't tell the tower I was nervous, <lead>. Going around.
[joker] Not happy with that one. Going around.
[joker] Power up, going around. Let's try that again.
[joker] Going around. It's not a failed landing, it's a bonus lap.
[joker rain] Going around. Wet runway, dry sense of humour.

@wing.engaging tactical
[joker] Engaging. Time to earn the lousy pay.
[joker] Engaging, <lead>. Stay close, I bite.
[joker] I'm in. Engaging.
[joker] Engaging! Somebody has to do it.
[joker] Committing now. Cover me, <lead>.

@wing.fox2 tactical
[joker] Fox two on the <target>. Warm regards.
[joker] Fox two, <target>. Hope it's got good manners.
[joker] Heat's on, <target>. Fox two!
[joker] Cheers, <target>. Fox two, away.
[joker] Hot greetings incoming, <lead>. Fox two.

@wing.fox3 tactical
[joker] Fox three, <target>. Radar's got it, pray it does too.
[joker] Fox three on the <target>. Cheap missile, expensive guess.
[joker] Tracking the <target>. Fox three!
[joker] Good luck, <target>. Fox three, <lead>.
[joker] No refunds. Fox three, away.

@wing.magnum tactical
[joker] Magnum on the <target>. Radar's off, bad day.
[joker] Magnum! Silence the <target>.
[joker] They wanted attention, now they have it. Magnum, <target>.
[joker] Quiet please, <lead>. Magnum.
[joker] Magnum, away.

@wing.rifle tactical
[joker] Rifle on the <target>. Ground's about to get warmer.
[joker] Rifle! <target> is on the menu.
[joker] Rifle, <lead>. Dropping a surprise on the <target>.
[joker] Rifle, away. Nothing personal.
[joker] Rifle. Hope the <target> has insurance.

@wing.splash tactical
[joker] Splash one <target>. Put it on my tab.
[joker] Splash! The <target> is done, <lead>.
[joker] Splash one. One less <target> to worry about.
[joker] Splash. Tell the gunners it wasn't their fault.
[joker] Splash, <target>. Shop's closed.
[joker loss] Splash, <target>. One for the ones we lost.

@wing.bandit tactical
[joker] Bandit, <bra>. Someone brought a party.
