[joker] Bandit, <bra>. Look who's late.
[joker] New bandit, <bra>. That's trouble, <lead>.
[joker] Bandit <bra>, <type>. Not one of ours.

@wing.contact status
[joker] Contact, <bra>. Something on the ground. Not friendly.
