[joker] Bandit, <bra>. Closest one, <lead>.
[joker] Closest threat, <bra>. Don't say I didn't warn you.
[joker] Got one at <bra>. Pick your poison.
[joker] Bandit <bra>, <type>. That's the nearest.

@wing.clean tactical
[joker] Clean, <lead>. Nothing out there. Suspicious.
[joker] Naked. Nothing on the scope.
[joker] Picture is clean. Enjoy it while it lasts.
